{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "f2b9f5d7-5b8f-4d9d-9d1f-7d8b8f4b2c10",
    "name": "JosStay Premium API",
    "description": "Postman collection for the JosStay Premium backend API.\n\nSetup:\n- Set `baseUrl` (default: http://localhost:4000).\n- Start the server (`npm run dev:server` or `npm run start:server`). Works in demo mode (`DATA_BACKEND=demo`) and Postgres mode when configured.\n- Auth-protected requests inherit collection Bearer auth using `{{token}}`.\n\nSuggested flow (Collection Runner order):\n1. Health & Meta / Currency / Properties requests\n2. Auth → Register (captures token and credentials)\n3. Auth → Login and/or Get current user\n4. Bookings → Create booking (captures `bookingReference`), List bookings, Cancel booking\n5. Host → Get host payouts (requires a host/admin token; guest tokens return 403)\n\nNotes:\n- `POST /api/auth/register` rate-limits via auth limiter; avoid rapid repeated runs.\n- Create booking uses dynamically generated future dates to reduce conflicts, but availability still depends on backend state.\n- Sample catalogue values: property slug `crestview-boutique-hotel`, room `deluxe`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:4000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "registeredEmail", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "registeredPassword", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "bookingReference", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "checkIn", "value": "2027-01-10", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "checkOut", "value": "2027-01-13", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health & Meta",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET Health",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["health"]
            },
            "description": "Service health check. Returns status, backend (`demo` or `postgres`), sampleData flag, and time."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Health payload is ok', function () {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(json.status).to.eql('ok');",
                  "  pm.expect(json.service).to.eql('josstay-api');",
                  "  pm.expect(json).to.have.property('backend');",
                  "  pm.expect(json).to.have.property('time');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
